Georg Funke, Chairman of the Board of Directors of HRE, however, stated that the Hypo Real Estate group did not have to make use of financial markets for a foreseeable period of time.
The German Federal Bank and the Federal Financial Services Inspectorate (BaFin) state that the Hypo Real Estate group’s marketability is now insured.
