“While Hypo’s Real Estate bonds used to appear as speculative investment alternatives, their value-responsibility must now be regarded as dependent on the stability of the international financial system due to the escalation of the banking crisis and the fact that the financial institution has almost housed the crisis by accepting Depfa.
